      "id": "claim_39d16b04ebe7470596ddea3aaf2ce833",
      "statement": "Conditional rendering runs after cross-reference resolution and CTA decoration: it processes :::python and :::js blocks to retain content matching the target language and remove non-matching blocks; escaped blocks (\\:::) are preserved as literal text and unescaped in the output. Unsupported language specifiers are left unchanged and ValueError is raised if target_language is invalid.",
